</span></th>
<th id="A1.T4.6.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="A1.T4.6.1.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T4.6.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A1.T4.6.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Good Example</span></span>
