<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.I1.i3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">August 26, 2025 - Whales with a lot of money to spend have taken a noticeably bearish stance on Walmart. Looking at options history for Walmart WMT we detected 15 trades. If we consider the specifics of each trade, it is accurate to state that 33% of the investors opened trades with bullish expectations and 46% with bearish.</span></span>
</span></span>
