<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.I1.i6.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">August 24, 2025 - Walmart (NYSE:WMT) Price Target Raised to $114.00 Key Points - The Goldman Sachs Group has raised Walmart’s price target from $101.00 to $114.00, indicating a potential upside of 17.25% from its previous close.</span></span>
