<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.I1.i7.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">August 28, 2025 - On August 27, 2025, consumer staples retailer Walmart (WMT) had a turnover of $1.241 billion, ranking 44th in US stocks for the day. The turnover decreased by 41.91% from the previous day, and the trading volume was 12.9257 million shares.</span></span>
