</span></span>
<span id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<span id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">financecharts.com</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<span id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I3.i1.I1.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">fool.com</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A4.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A4.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A4.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Searched for ”AAPL August 31 2020 open 127.58”</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A4.p4.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p4.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">…
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A4.p4.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p4.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Response
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A4.p4.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">The most recent stock split for Apple Inc. (AAPL) was effective on August 31, 2020, with a split ratio of 4-for-1.</span></span></span>
<span id="A4.p4.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p4.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">On that date, the opening price was $127.58, compared to the previous closing price of $499.23 on August 28, 2020. The change was -$371.65.
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
